write(d/'DISCLOSURE.md','''# Review disclosure\n\nAll 22 packets and all 70 unique visible text windows were reviewed; repeated byte-identical excerpts were reused, truncated tool output reread. Single familiar reviewer; oracle accessibility was previously reviewed, so this is partial masking, not independent or fully blind adjudication. Arm/case key and aggregate were not opened during semantic annotation. Actual Claims constrain novelty. No containing-paper title is inferred from an untitled bibliography preview.\n\nMedium-ambiguity bridge labels and the rejected Borderlands temporal candidate are preserved for sensitivity. Primary labels are committed before aggregate. General tax gifts, faculty lists and artist-plane-crash lists are not automatically gains. Material opportunity does not certify final target identity or admit a persistent Claim.\n\nQueries sometimes incorporate Q context absent from the supplied objective, violating TASK33 rule2. These are separately recorded as objective-only contract deviations. They are not labeled semantic drift when the added context is actually supported by Q and remains about the same parent; no unsupported concrete candidate was inserted. The full objective-only compliance sensitivity is reported alongside primary gates.\n''')
